              <div class="accordion-body">
                <ul class="step-list">
                  <li><span class="step-num">1</span>Install CommerceForge CLI globally.</li>
                  <li><span class="step-num">2</span>Navigate to the directory where you want to create your theme.</li>
                  <li><span class="step-num">3</span>Run the command below to clone a starter theme in a new subdirectory.</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="code-block">
                  <div class="code-tabs">
                    <button class="code-tab active" onclick="switchTab(this, 'themes-npm')">npm</button>
                    <button class="code-tab" onclick="switchTab(this, 'themes-yarn')">yarn</button>
                    <button class="code-tab" onclick="switchTab(this, 'themes-pnpm')">pnpm</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="code-content active" id="themes-npm"><span class="code-comment"># Install CLI globally</span>
<span class="code-cmd">npm</span> i <span class="code-flag">-g</span> <span class="code-str">@commerceforge/cli@latest</span></div>
                  <div class="code-content" id="themes-yarn"><span class="code-comment"># Install CLI globally</span>
